Z||000000||2xsess||01-28-2001||04:44 AM||||I read this in the Army Times which is a weekly publication.<P>This was at The National Training Center in CA.<BR>They were a 23 year old and a 25 year old. They were in their tent using a propane heater to try to stay warm. I guess they had it sealed up pretty tight. Carbon Monoxide poisoning. It's so sad to me as a service member to hear of soldiers dying in a peacetime environment. Plus my unit just returned from the same place in November of 2000. <P><p>[This message has been edited by 2xsess (edited 01-28-2001).]||||reg||9
